{title: Shine, Jesus, Shine (FJ_201_en)}
{song_number: 201}
{language: en}
{key: A}
{tempo: 110}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[A]Lord, the light of Your [A]love is [E]shining
[A]in the midst of the [A]darkness, [E]shining;
[D]Jesus, Light of the World, [C#m7]shine [F#m]upon us,
[D]set us free by the [C#m7]truth You now [F#m]bring us,
[G]shine on [E]me, [G]shine on [E]me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Shine, Jesus, [A]shine, [A]fill this [Bm]land with the [Esus4]Father's glory;
[A]blaze, Spirit, [A]blaze, [D]set our [Bm]heart on [G]fire. [E]
[A]Flow, river, [A]flow, [A]flood the [Bm]nations with [Esus4]grace and mercy;
[A]send forth Your [A]word, [D]Lord, [Bm]and [D6]let [E7]there be [A]light.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[A]Lord, I come to Your [A]awesome [E]presence.
[A]From the shadows in[A]to Your [E]radiance;
[D]By the blood I may [C#m7]enter Your [F#m]brightness.
[D]Search me, try me, [C#m7]consume all my [F#m]darkness.
[G]Shine on [E]me, [G]shine on [E]me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Shine, Jesus, [A]shine, [A]fill this [Bm]land with the [Esus4]Father's glory;
[A]blaze, Spirit, [A]blaze, [D]set our [Bm]heart on [G]fire. [E]
[A]Flow, river, [A]flow, [A]flood the [Bm]nations with [Esus4]grace and mercy;
[A]send forth Your [A]word, [D]Lord, [Bm]and [D6]let [E7]there be [A]light.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[A]As we gaze on Your [A]kingly [E]brightness,
[A]so our faces dis[A]play Your [E]likeness.
[D]Ever changing from [C#m7]glory to [F#m]glory,
[D]mirrored here may our [C#m7]lives tell Your [F#m]story.
[G]Shine on [E]me, [G]shine on [E]me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Shine, Jesus, [A]shine, [A]fill this [Bm]land with the [Esus4]Father's glory;
[A]blaze, Spirit, [A]blaze, [D]set our [Bm]heart on [G]fire. [E]
[A]Flow, river, [A]flow, [A]flood the [Bm]nations with [Esus4]grace and mercy;
[A]send forth Your [A]word, [D]Lord, [Bm]and [D6]let [E7]there be [A]light.
